  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• Pat dry firm tofu dry, then cut into 2cm chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine the plain flour, satay seasoning and tofu.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66cd78224ac430fcc0016f0f-51dfd305.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To a large bowl, add peanut butter and the boiling water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P) and whisk until smooth.\n• Add sweet chilli sauce, soy sauce mix, a good squeeze of lemon juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Whisk to combine and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66cd78224ac430fcc0016f0f-38ffca11.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes. Season with a good pinch of salt and pepper",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66cd78224ac430fcc0016f0f-eeb8a934.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the peanut dressing, add shredded cabbage mix, mixed salad leaves and cucumber. Season to taste.\n• Divide salad between bowls, then top with satay tofu.\n• Sprinkle with crushed peanuts and chilli to serve. Enjoy",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66cd78224ac430fcc0016f0f-1715ea50.jpeg"
    }
  ]
